p #(span-key bs (:start %) (:end %)) items)]\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1149:      ;; ClojureDart's list constructor attaches call-site metadata;\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1150:      ;; a decoded list carries none until a with-meta frame adds it.\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1151:      #?(:cljd (with-meta (apply list (map #(item->value bs %) (:value p))) nil)\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1155:    (\"dao.jing/keyword\" \"dao.jing/symbol\")\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1165:        (if (= frame-name \"dao.jing/keyword\")\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1166:          (keyword ns (:value name-item))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1175:    \"clojure/with-meta\"\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1178:                                      \"with-meta payload is not [meta value]\"))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1182:        (refuse :malformed-frame \"metadata is not a map\"))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1184:        (refuse :malformed-frame \"metadata map carries metadata\"))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1188:                \"metadata target is not a bare collection or symbol\"))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1189:      (with-meta v m))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/cbor.cljc:1211:             (check-members bs (map first v) (map first pairs) :duplicate-key)\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:21:   every NaN (and `-0.0` unequal to `0.0`); its hash is that of its bit\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:22:   text, every NaN hashing alike; it refuses implicit numeric coercion\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:25:   hashes as the vector of its fields. They print as\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:31:   are exact-integer carriers of `dao.host.integer` (`exact-integer?`) or\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:34:   class keyword, and `:dao.host/entry`. Every reader conditional names\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:39:  #?@(:cljd [(:import [\"dart:core\" BigInt])]\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:40:      :clj [(:import (java.math BigDecimal BigInteger))]))\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:52:  (if (integer/exact-integer? x)\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:97:     (-equiv\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:104:     IHash\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:106:     (-hash [_] (hash (if (js/isNaN v) \"nan\" (double-bits-hex v))))\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:119:             (-equiv [_ other]\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:123:             cljd.core/IHash\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:124:             (-hash [_] (hash [(str numerator) (str denominator)]))]\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:130:            (hashCode [_] (hash [numerator denominator]))\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:132:            clojure.lang.IHashEq\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:133:            (hasheq [_] (hash [numerator denominator]))]\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:135:             (-equiv [_ other]\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:139:             IHash\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:140:             (-hash [_] (hash [(str numerator) (str denominator)]))\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:153:     (-equiv\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:160:     cljd.core/IHash\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:162:     (-hash [_] (hash [exponent (str mantissa)])))\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:169:     (-equiv\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:176:     IHash\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:178:     (-hash [_] (hash [exponent (str mantissa)]))\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:252:    #?(:cljd (Decimal. (.toInt ^BigInt e) m)\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:253:       :clj (BigDecimal. ^BigInteger m (int (- (.longValue ^BigInteger e))))\nsrc/cljc/dao/host/number.cljc:302:                (clojure.lang.Ratio. ^BigInteger n ^BigInteger d))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
